message: "If you use or discuss this research, please cite the HDBLAST Zenodo record (all versions)."
title: "HDBLAST: could a higher-dimensional blast have sparked the hot Big Bang? (research program, code and data)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Maldonado
    given-names: Ricardo
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.17088132
url: "https://maldonado-research.github.io/HDblast/"
